  "solution": "**Given :**\n\n104.96 + 120.96 + 103.16 - 12.89 × 2.04 + 124.93 ÷ 5.1 = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/29a135f443948547e45dcbc29159de16b3378c26dafbd9d2125f8e48d83be079.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n**104.96 + 120.96 + 103.16 - 12.89 × 2.04 + 124.93 ÷ 5.1\\\\=104.96+120.96+103.16-12.89× 2.04 +24.5\\\\=104.96+120.96+103.16-26.3+24.5\\\\=353.58-26.3\\\\=327.73∼328**\n\nHence the closest approximate value is **328.**",
